.env
.env.*
agent_config.yaml
agent_config.*.yaml
# The templates hold placeholders, so they are the files that stand a band up
# and belong in the repository.
!.env.example
!agent_config.example.yaml
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
venv/
.venv/
.DS_Store
out/
# `*.log` is runtime output everywhere except one place. `README.md` sends a judge to
# `docs/harness-runs/` for the per-suite pytest logs, and that promise was empty: the rule
# below swallowed all thirteen of them, so a clone got the table of contents and none of the
# evidence. They are 56K in total and they are the reason the run is kept rather than
# summarised.
*.log
!docs/harness-runs/**/*.log
room.*.json
room.download.json
band-agents/.venv/
band-agents/uv.lock
